{"id":"4b52d3210eeab41d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-conservation.md","title":"Conservative Extension","display":"df-conservation — Conservative Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-conservation","aliases":["93-df-conservation","93-df-conservative-extension"],"display":"df-conservation — Conservative Extension","depends_on":["[[93-df-extension]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-language]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-conservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-conservation</span><span>93-df-conservative-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conservation — Conservative Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f\" href=\"?note=a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f\" title=\"93-df-extension\">93-df-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a33dcee0f62c9026\" href=\"?note=a33dcee0f62c9026\" title=\"93-df-language\">93-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf L_0,\\mathsf L_1\">\\(\\mathsf L_0,\\mathsf L_1\\)</span> are logic-presentation candidates; their languages, formula sets, and consequence relations are bound in the assertion.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the type-indexed finitary structural-logic predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f\" href=\"?note=a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f\" title=\"93-df-extension\">93-df-extension</a> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conservative}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conservative}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Conservative}_{93}(\\mathsf L_1,\\mathsf L_0)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1,F_0,F_1,\\vdash_0,\\vdash_1\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf L_0=\\langle\\mathcal L_0,F_0,\\vdash_0\\rangle\n\\land\\mathsf L_1=\\langle\\mathcal L_1,F_1,\\vdash_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land F_0=T_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land F_1=T_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\land F_0\\subseteq F_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(F_0,\\vdash_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(F_1,\\vdash_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F_0\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F_0\\;(\\Gamma\\vdash_1\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_0\\varphi)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservation}\\vdash\\mathrm{Conservative}_{93}(\\mathsf L_1,\\mathsf L_0)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1,S_0,\\alpha_0,S_1,\\alpha_1,F_0,F_1,\\vdash_0,\\vdash_1\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf L_0=\\langle\\mathcal L_0,F_0,\\vdash_0\\rangle\n\\land\\mathsf L_1=\\langle\\mathcal L_1,F_1,\\vdash_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal L_0=\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal L_1=\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land F_0=T_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land F_1=T_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LangSub}_{93}(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_1)\\land F_0\\subseteq F_1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\langle S_0,\\alpha_0\\rangle}(F_0,\\vdash_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\langle S_1,\\alpha_1\\rangle}(F_1,\\vdash_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F_0\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F_0\\;(\\Gamma\\vdash_1\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_0\\varphi)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each presentation is unpacked inside the predicate, and its formula universe is generated by its own language signature. Language inclusion, both logic predicates, and arbitrary-premise consequence preservation are all checked on those recovered components.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"a1bbaa8bc1a8f86f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数